\cf7 \cb6 \strokec7 2:39\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb6 \strokec2 it might extract a table and then further extract the table structure,\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf7 \cb6 \strokec7 2:43\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb6 \strokec2 identifying rows, columns, merged cells, and so on.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf7 \cb6 \strokec7 2:47\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb6 \strokec2 In this course, you'll explore traditional OCR-based processing pipelines\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf7 \cb6 \strokec7 2:51\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb6 \strokec2 to see what they can do and also their limitations.\cb1 \
